# Copy to .env.local (git-ignored) and adjust, or set these in your deployment.

# Base URL of the FastAPI backend, with no trailing slash.
#
# Vite inlines this at BUILD time, not at run time: `npm run build` bakes the
# value in, so a change here needs a rebuild, and one bundle cannot serve two
# environments.
#
# Leave it unset and the app calls the host that served the page on port 8000
# (http://192.168.1.5:5173 -> http://192.168.1.5:8000), which is usually what
# you want for local work and for reaching it from a phone on the same
# network. Set it explicitly when the API is somewhere else.
#
# VITE_API_URL=https://api.example.com
